[about]
Title=10 - Conclusion
Intro=What to carry away from the walks, in four sentences, and where to begin.
Setup=Nothing is needed.
Homework=Open the file you work in most and change one line.

[step]

Say=Four things to carry away. A key is named for a word of its command, so it can be guessed, and the Alternate Menu tells you any key you have not learned. Alt says, Control does, Shift widens. A document in any format becomes text you can read, and your text becomes any format. And the AI is on your own machine.
Key=
Hear=

[step]

Say=Start with the file you work in most. Open it, change a line, save it, and let the keys come as you need them; the guide and the Key Describer are there for the ones you do not know yet.
Key=
Hear=
